{"id":"vod_bf_11270","vodId":"11270","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"怪物弹珠第四季","name_cn":"怪物弹珠第四季","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-12/4a6a8fb3de4160a68cd4d74bda41b9b9.jpg"},"summary":"怪物弹珠第四季动画季度太乱，第一季播出后停播一季度播出后半（第一季、第二季（即第一季后半））、之后第三季（官方写第二季就是变3D那个、分前篇和后续的消失的宇宙篇）、接着是本作怪物弹珠2018新系列（第四季或者说第三季） 故事讲述了主人公·焰莲回到曾经住过的街道·神之原，感受到了违和感。他确实应该在这条街道住过，却对那时的事情没有记忆。此时，莲的智能手机突然被安装了从没见过的游戏，其名为《怪物弹珠》。他带着从手机中飞向现实世界的怪物，在街道中展开了战斗！经过战斗，莲注意到了在自己体内沉睡的谜之记忆的正体，以及，怪物弹珠究竟是何物。与握有钥匙的水泽葵、影月明、若叶皆实一起，如今的莲正迈出通往谜团的一步，对于前方沉睡着无法想象的真相一事，仍然一无所知。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:54:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guaiwudanzhudisiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/g